<title>USA: BFGoodrich Co Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>BFGoodrich Co Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>RICHFIELD, Ohio 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.54		    $0.44</p>
<p> Net			 29,300		   23,200</p>
<p> Revs		     589,800		  517,200</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	54,400		   53,000</p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr primary		$2.81		    $2.15</p>
<p> Net			151,700		  118,000</p>
<p> Revs		   2,238,800		2,049,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	54,000		   52,300</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Above results include effects of discontinued operations.</p>
<p>Q4 earnings per share from continuing operations: $0.49 vs $0.47.</p>
<p>Year earnings per share from continuing operations $1.97 vs $2.00.</p>
